<section class="admin-panel"><p><strong><?= (int)$totals['count'] ?></strong> registros · bruto <?= e($money($totals['gross_cents'])) ?> · líquido <?= e($money($totals['paid_cents'])) ?></p><p>Exibindo os 50 registros mais recentes. Os totais consideram todos os registros dos filtros.</p><div class="admin-table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Usuário</th><th>Plano</th><th>Gateway</th><th>Status</th><th>Pago</th><th>Estornado</th><th>Líquido</th></tr></thead><tbody>
